note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note Diagnostic group stream:35-byte requests,20-byte replies. Not checkpoint IO.
note Request rule:u8,scale:u16le,32E4M3FN bytes. Reply status,E,16packed,clip,zero.
note Batch transport is bounded to512 groups, emitting every complete input frame.
global request uchar 17920
global reply uchar 10240
fn frame index ulong to void
src = mul index 35
dst = mul index 20
for i ulong 32
put qinput i get request add add src i 3
end
scale = or ulong get request add src 1 shl ulong get request add src 2 8
status = qpack scale ulong get request src
put reply dst uchar status
put reply add dst 1 uchar get qmeta 1
for i ulong 16
put reply add add dst i 2 get qoutput i
end
put reply add dst 18 uchar get qmeta 3
put reply add dst 19 uchar get qmeta 2
end
fn main to int
have = ulong 0
while eq ulong 1 1
count = read 0 request have sub 17920 have
if lt count 0
ret 74
end
if eq count 0
if eq have 0
ret 0
end
ret 65
end
total = add have ulong count
frames = div total 35
for i ulong frames
frame i
end
sent = ulong 0
while lt sent mul frames 20
count = write 1 reply sent sub mul frames 20 sent
if le count 0
ret 74
end
sent = add sent ulong count
end
have = sub total mul frames 35
for i ulong have
put request i get request add mul frames 35 i
end
end
ret 0
end
